When someone uses a [[Cathedral Center]] to heal, the service is free but to recoup costs they have to watch an ad. 

The ad plays for a number of seconds equal to the number of times the player has visited a Cathedral Center during their playthrough. 

There are no ads for other sources of healing, like the [[Team Bazaar]] providers. 

